NOTE ON SCOPE

The MIT terms above cover the code, scripts and tests.

The manuscript (paper/draft-v1.md, main.tex and the compiled PDF) and the figures are
made available under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The price snapshots under data/snapshots/ are derived from publicly available market
data and are redistributed here only so that the reported results can be reproduced
exactly. They carry the sha256 manifests used to verify them; no ownership of the
underlying market data is claimed.
